commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and
indicate if changes were made.

Full text:  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Summary:    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Suggested attribution:
  Nordstern disease register, fndtn (https://fndtn.io), CC BY 4.0.
  Cite a record by its permanent id (FND-D-NNNN) and a rating by its
  assertion id (FND-A-NNNN); slugs may be renamed, ids never are.

Disease identifiers (`mondo:`) are borrowed from the Mondo Disease Ontology,
which is itself CC BY 4.0: https://mondo.monarchinitiative.org/

The code that reads and checks these records is under the MIT licence in the
repository root.
